{"id":"b55493abffb83a37","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-recursive-set.md","title":"Recursive Set","display":"df-recursive-set — Recursive Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-recursive-set","aliases":["88-df-recursive-set"],"display":"df-recursive-set — Recursive Set","depends_on":["[[88-df-decidable-set]]","[[88-df-recursive-set-def]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-recursive-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-recursive-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursive-set — Recursive Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a11968829091ae7f\" href=\"?note=a11968829091ae7f\" title=\"88-df-recursive-set-def\">88-df-recursive-set-def</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (candidate subset of natural numbers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)\\)</span> (decidable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecursiveSet}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{RecursiveSet}(A)\\)</span> (recursive-set predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecSet}\">\\(\\mathrm{RecSet}\\)</span> (recursive-set class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a11968829091ae7f\" href=\"?note=a11968829091ae7f\" title=\"88-df-recursive-set-def\">88-df-recursive-set-def</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RecursiveSet}(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(A\\in\\mathrm{RecSet}\n\\land A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\n\\land\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RecursiveSet}(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(A\\in\\mathrm{RecSet}\n\\land A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\n\\land\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>递归集与可判定集同义；其特征函数只需总可计算，不要求原始递归</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecSet}\">\\(\\mathrm{RecSet}\\)</span>始终是类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecursiveSet}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{RecursiveSet}(A)\\)</span>始终是谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"a6c52aed1a56207b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-recursive-set-def","status":"resolved","id":"a11968829091ae7f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-recursive-set-def]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"a6c52aed1a56207b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)$ (decidable-set predicate, see [[88-df-decidable-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-recursive-set-def","status":"resolved","id":"a11968829091ae7f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RecSet}$ (recursive-set class, see [[88-df-recursive-set-def]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecursiveSet}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecSet}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RecursiveSet}(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(A\\in\\mathrm{RecSet}\n\\land A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\n\\land\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecSet}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecursiveSet}(A)","display":false}],"bytes":963,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11968829091ae7f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"此原子定义集合类$\\mathrm{RecSet}$；逐对象谓词由[[88-df-recursive-set]]\n单独登记，避免同一符号一会儿作类、一会儿作谓词。"},{"id":"30ed84949602d59d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RecSet}(K_{\\mathrm{diag}})$ (recursive-set predicate, see [[88-df-recursive-set]])"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-107","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-delta.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-sigma.md]]\n[[88-df-assignment.md]]\n[[88-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-axiom.md]]\n[[88-df-bijective.md]]\n[[88-df-bound-variable.md]]\n[[88-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[88-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[88-df-cardinality.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[88-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[88-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[88-df-compactness.md]]\n[[88-df-completeness.md]]\n[[88-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[88-df-consistent.md]]\n[[88-df-countable.md]]\n[[88-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[88-df-decidable-set.md]]\n[[88-df-